  "description": "Bringing Twmpa ride quality to the daily commute allows you to combine work and play whether you're navigating city traffic, pot-holed roads or just popping to the shop.\n\nSmooth Strong Fast Beautiful\n\nSingle speed or geared options\nBelt drive for clean running or traditional chain drive\nCarbon fork with cable routing for dynamo lighting\nOptional hub dynamo lighting package\nAvailable as frameset only or complete build\nHand built in Wales using carefully selected British Ash\nSleeved internal cable routing\nStandard bottle mounts on seat tube and down tube\nMud guard and rack mounting points\nCan be supplied complete with mud guards and rack\nLively geometry for precise handling in traffic\nLaminated bamboo handlebar\n\nThe ultimate expression of simplicity and exceptional British craftsmanship. No mess, no chain, no gears, no problem",
